---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Spatial Acoustic Intelligence" description="Open spatial acoustic intelligence infrastructure — hear the event, understand the physics.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-violet/5 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] rounded-full bg-cyan/5 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-24 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-xs text-white/60 mb-8">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan animate-pulse"></span>
        Phase VI — Project Helix
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        Hear the event.<br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan to-violet bg-clip-text text-transparent">Understand the physics.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/60 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        Spatial acoustic intelligence built from measurable evidence.
        Calibrated instruments. Cryptographic provenance. Physics-first correlation.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="https://github.com/resonance-project/resonance" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan to-violet text-graphite font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
          View on GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="/developers" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/15 text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
          Documentation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Product Family -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">The Resonance Platform</h2>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Eight integrated products covering the full lifecycle from acoustic acquisition to evidentiary output.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-cyan/30 hover:bg-cyan/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-cyan">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Detect</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Real-time acoustic classification with ML-powered detection and direction of arrival.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-violet/30 hover:bg-violet/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-violet">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zm10 0a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zm10 0a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Mesh</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Cross-node spatial correlation turning individual observations into located incidents.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-cyan/30 hover:bg-cyan/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-cyan">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l4.553 2.276A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Field</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Deployment planning, site survey, and mesh optimization tools.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-violet/30 hover:bg-violet/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-violet">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Fleet</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Large-scale node management, OTA updates, health monitoring, and predictive maintenance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-cyan/30 hover:bg-cyan/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-cyan">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Evidence</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Cryptographic provenance chain producing court-admissible evidentiary packages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-violet/30 hover:bg-violet/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-violet">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Lab</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Research environment for algorithm development, model training, and acoustic analysis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-cyan/30 hover:bg-cyan/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-cyan">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Edge</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">On-node runtime handling acquisition, DSP, privacy filtering, and local inference.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-violet/30 hover:bg-violet/5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-violet">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">SDK</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Public developer library for building custom acoustic detectors and integrations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture Pipeline -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">12-Stage Processing Pipeline</h2>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">From acoustic wavefront to evidentiary output in milliseconds. Every stage produces measurable, attributable data.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan/50 via-violet/50 to-transparent hidden lg:block"></div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Acquisition</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">12-ch array capture at 48–192 kHz, hardware-timestamped, PPS-locked</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Calibration</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Per-channel gain, phase, and frequency response correction</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Detection</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Adaptive energy thresholding with noise floor tracking</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-violet/10 text-violet text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Feature Extraction</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">MFCC, spectral centroid, ZCR, envelope, WavePrint fingerprint</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-violet/10 text-violet text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">5</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Classification</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">ML inference on NPU — multi-class with confidence and alternatives</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-violet/10 text-violet text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">6</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">DOA Estimation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">VectorWave beamforming — azimuth, elevation, confidence cone</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">7</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Atmosphere</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Wind, temperature, humidity correction for propagation speed</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">8</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Privacy Kernel</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Real-time speech detection and suppression before any storage</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">9</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Signing</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Ed25519 cryptographic attribution of every observation</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-violet/10 text-violet text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">10</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Correlation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Cross-node temporal and spatial fusion via TDOA + APS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-violet/10 text-violet text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">11</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Incident Fusion</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Multi-observation evidence aggregation into located incidents</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-violet/10 text-violet text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">12</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Provenance</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Tamper-evident chain producing court-admissible evidence packages</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Competitive Comparison -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Why Resonance</h2>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Purpose-built for spatial acoustic intelligence. Not adapted from surveillance, not limited to single-point sensing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-white/10">
            <th class="text-left py-4 px-4 text-white/50 font-medium">Capability</th>
            <th class="text-center py-4 px-4 text-cyan font-semibold">Resonance</th>
            <th class="text-center py-4 px-4 text-white/50 font-medium">Single-Sensor</th>
            <th class="text-center py-4 px-4 text-white/50 font-medium">Legacy Acoustic</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="text-white/70">
          <tr class="border-b border-white/5">
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Direction of Arrival</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">12-channel spatial array</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">None</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Limited (3-4 mic)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-white/5">
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Timing Precision</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">GNSS PPS ≤15 ns</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">NTP (~10 ms)</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">NTP (~10 ms)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-white/5">
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Environmental Compensation</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">Real-time Atmos</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">None</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Manual offset</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-white/5">
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Cryptographic Provenance</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">Per-observation Ed25519</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">None</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">None</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-white/5">
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Multi-Node Correlation</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">Mesh-wide TDOA + APS</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">N/A</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Basic clustering</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-white/5">
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Privacy Architecture</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">Hardware kernel, on-device</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Cloud processing</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Post-hoc filtering</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4">Open Source</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-cyan">Apache-2.0</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Proprietary</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-white/30">Proprietary</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
    <div class="p-12 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan/5 via-transparent to-violet/5">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Build with Resonance</h2>
      <p class="text-white/50 mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">Open source, open hardware, open science. Join the community building spatial acoustic intelligence infrastructure.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="https://github.com/resonance-project/resonance" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-graphite font-semibold hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors">
          Star on GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="/developers" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/15 text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
          Read the Docs
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
